  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 12550e90c236e0541b910f7291e37631, type: 3}
  m_Name: NPC_Orbitron5
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueFinal
  Node:
  - sentences:
    - text: "You know, they say unity is our greatest strength\u2026. In my experience
        it causes too many issues."
  - sentences:
    - text: "You know I hear there\u2019s some new cloning advancements that companies
        are going to start using to create self-replicating bio-workers."
    - text: Can you believe it?
    - text: What jobs are all the hardworking robots like me going to do then?!
  - sentences:
    - text: "Do you know what Orbitron is named after? No? We actually don\u2019t
        know either! It was lost in our records long ago unfortunately, but there
        are many theories!"
    - text: Some say ours was the first spherical planet ever discovered and was
        hence named after its shape. Some say our founders just liked the sound of
        it!
    - text: "Some theories even suggest the name was given to appease some unholy
        force terrorizing innocents\u2026\u2026 Like I said, there are many theories."
